</Fragment>
    <svg width="0" height="0" style="position:absolute" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
      <symbol id="i-arrow" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 12h15M13 6l6 6-6 6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></symbol>
      <symbol id="i-down-right" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 5l13 13M18 8v10H8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></symbol>
    </svg>

    <section class="hero hero-about" aria-labelledby="about-title">
      <span class="hbar hbar-1" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span class="hbar hbar-2" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span class="hbar hbar-3" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span class="hbar hbar-4" aria-hidden="true"></span>

      <div class="ah-copy">
        <p class="ah-label" data-reveal>About me</p>
        <h1 id="about-title" data-speakable>
          <span class="line">About</span>
          <span class="line line-2">Aldrich Matthew</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="ah-intro" data-reveal data-speakable>I build websites and funnels that help businesses grow, with clean design, smart development, and a focus on results.</p>
      </div>

      <figure class="ah-portrait" data-reveal>
        <svg class="ah-ring" viewBox="0 0 600 700" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M150 360C90 210 190 60 340 70c140 10 235 130 215 280-18 140-110 240-230 290" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke"/></svg>
        <img src="assets/img/aldrich-about.webp" alt="Portrait of Aldrich Matthew, website and funnel designer and developer, looking down at the camera" width="1000" height="1192" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high">
      </figure>

      <a class="ah-down" href="#intro" aria-label="Scroll to the introduction"><svg width="34" height="34" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-down-right"/></svg></a>
    </section>

    <section class="ab ab-dark" id="intro" aria-labelledby="intro-title">
      <div class="ab-in ab-split">
        <header class="ab-head">
          <p class="ab-k" data-rise>About</p>
          <h2 id="intro-title">I&rsquo;m Aldrich Matthew.</h2>
        </header>
        <div class="ab-body">
          <p class="ab-lead" data-rise data-speakable>I design and build websites, not just the screens people see.</p>
          <p data-rise>I&rsquo;m an independent website designer and developer based in the Philippines. My work sits between visual design, front-end development, and the systems that handle what happens after someone visits a website.</p>
          <p data-rise>I work with businesses that need more than an online brochure, from presenting their services properly to giving potential customers a clearer way to make an inquiry.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="ab ab-amber" id="thinking" aria-labelledby="thinking-title">
      <span class="ab-bar ab-bar-l" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span class="ab-bar ab-bar-r" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <div class="ab-in ab-split">
        <header class="ab-head">
          <p class="ab-k" data-rise>How I think about websites</p>
          <h2 id="thinking-title">A good-looking website isn&rsquo;t enough.</h2>
        </header>
        <div class="ab-body">
          <p data-rise>A visitor shouldn&rsquo;t have to figure out what a business does, search through confusing menus, or guess where to go next.</p>
          <p data-rise>I pay attention to how information is presented, how each page connects, and what happens when someone decides to take action.</p>
          <p class="ab-strong" data-rise>That thinking carries through the entire build, from the first layout to the final form submission.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="ab ab-dark" id="work-i-do" aria-labelledby="doing-title">
      <div class="ab-in">
        <header class="ab-head ab-head-wide">
          <p class="ab-k" data-rise>The work I do</p>
          <h2 id="doing-title">Different builds. Different requirements.</h2>
        </header>
        <ol class="ab-rows">
          <li data-rise>
            <span class="ab-n">01</span>
            <h3>Business websites</h3>
            <p>Custom-designed websites that give businesses a clear way to present their services, work, and contact information.</p>
          </li>
          <li data-rise>
            <span class="ab-n">02</span>
            <h3>Landing pages &amp; funnels</h3>
            <p>Pages structured around a specific offer, campaign, or customer journey, with a clear path from the first visit to the intended action.</p>
          </li>
          <li data-rise>
            <span class="ab-n">03</span>
            <h3>CRM &amp; automation</h3>
            <p>Form connections, lead capture, tagging, follow-up workflows, and integrations that reduce the need to handle every inquiry manually.</p>
          </li>
          <li data-rise>
            <span class="ab-n">04</span>
            <h3>Interactive front-end development</h3>
            <p>Custom HTML, CSS, and JavaScript, with GSAP and Lenis when motion and interaction serve a real purpose.</p>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="ab ab-white" id="tools" aria-labelledby="tools-title">
      <div class="ab-in">
        <div class="ab-split">
          <header class="ab-head">
            <p class="ab-k" data-rise>The tools behind the build</p>
            <h2 id="tools-title">I choose the stack around the project.</h2>
          </header>
          <div class="ab-body">
            <p data-rise>I work across website platforms and custom front-end code. The setup depends on what needs to be built, what needs to connect, and how much control the project requires.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <ul class="tool-grid" aria-label="Tools and platforms I work with">
            <li data-rise><img src="assets/img/tools/canva.webp" alt="Canva logo" width="200" height="200" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span>Canva</span></li>
            <li data-rise><img src="assets/img/tools/capcut.webp" alt="CapCut logo" width="200" height="200" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span>CapCut</span></li>
            <li data-rise><img src="assets/img/tools/gohighlevel.webp" alt="GoHighLevel logo, three rising arrows" width="200" height="200" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span>GoHighLevel</span></li>
            <li data-rise><img src="assets/img/tools/n8n.webp" alt="n8n logo" width="200" height="200" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span>n8n</span></li>
            <li data-rise><img src="assets/img/tools/shopify.webp" alt="Shopify logo, a shopping bag with an S" width="200" height="200" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span>Shopify</span></li>
            <li data-rise><img src="assets/img/tools/systeme-io.webp" alt="Systeme.io logo" width="200" height="200" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span>Systeme.io</span></li>
            <li data-rise><img src="assets/img/tools/zapier.webp" alt="Zapier logo, an orange asterisk" width="200" height="200" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span>Zapier</span></li>
        </ul>

        <dl class="tool-list">
          <div data-rise><dt>Platforms</dt><dd>Systeme.io, GoHighLevel, Shopify</dd></div>
          <div data-rise><dt>Development</dt><dd>HTML, CSS, JavaScript, Shopify Liquid</dd></div>
          <div data-rise><dt>Motion</dt><dd>GSAP, Lenis</dd></div>
          <div data-rise><dt>Automation</dt><dd>Systeme.io workflows, GoHighLevel, Zapier, Make</dd></div>
        </dl>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="ab ab-dark" id="how-it-works" aria-labelledby="steps-title">
      <div class="ab-in">
        <header class="ab-head ab-head-wide">
          <p class="ab-k" data-rise>From first discussion to final build</p>
          <h2 id="steps-title">Here&rsquo;s how a project takes shape.</h2>
        </header>
        <ol class="ab-steps">
          <li data-rise>
            <span class="ab-n">01</span>
            <h3>Understand</h3>
            <p>We discuss the business, the people you&rsquo;re trying to reach, and what the website needs to accomplish.</p>
          </li>
          <li data-rise>
            <span class="ab-n">02</span>
            <h3>Structure</h3>
            <p>I work out the page hierarchy, content flow, visual direction, and functionality before development begins.</p>
          </li>
          <li data-rise>
            <span class="ab-n">03</span>
            <h3>Develop</h3>
            <p>I build the approved direction, implement the interactions, and connect the required forms, integrations, and workflows.</p>
          </li>
          <li data-rise>
            <span class="ab-n">04</span>
            <h3>Test &amp; launch</h3>
            <p>I check the website across screen sizes, test its functionality and integrations, then prepare it for launch.</p>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="ab ab-amber ab-cta" id="lets-talk" aria-labelledby="talk-title">
      <span class="ab-bar ab-bar-l" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span class="ab-bar ab-bar-r" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <div class="ab-in">
        <h2 id="talk-title">Let&rsquo;s talk about the build.</h2>
        <div class="ab-cta-body">
          <p class="ab-lead" data-rise>Have a website, landing page, or business process that needs attention?</p>
          <p data-rise>Tell me what you&rsquo;re working on. We can start with the requirements and work out whether I&rsquo;m the right person to build it.</p>
          <div class="ab-cta-actions" data-rise>
            <a class="cta cta-solid" href="https://calendly.com/-aldrichmatthew/15mins"><span>Book Free Strategy Call</span><svg width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></a>
            <a class="cta cta-ghost" href="#contact"><span>Send a message</span><svg width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <dl class="cta-facts" data-rise>
          <div><dt>Email</dt><dd><a href="mailto:madfunneldesign@gmail.com">madfunneldesign@gmail.com</a></dd></div>
          <div><dt>Phone</dt><dd><a href="tel:+639064888321">+63 906 488 8321</a></dd></div>
          <div><dt>Based in</dt><dd>The Philippines, working with businesses worldwide</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Local time</dt><dd>Manila <time data-clock datetime="">--:--</time></dd></div>
        </dl>
      </div>
    </section>

    <Contact />
  
</Base>
